# Core builds in binding repositories' CI when check-no-core-build.sh
# (VCI01, ADR-025) arrived on 2026-11-03, one line per occurrence as
# "<repo> <file> <command>". This list may only shrink: delete a line
# with the build it names.
#   android: none since android!771 (2026-11-03): Core publishes the host
#     library and runs the reproducibility check itself.
#   linux-qt: the vauchi-cabi build; it goes when the Qt pairing moves into
#     linux-app and linux-qt becomes qt-display (ADR-078, private#1029).
linux-qt .gitlab-ci.yml cargo build --release -p vauchi-cabi --features secure-storage
